        {
          "text": "Muakuidi, muana wa Alona, neikale ne Bena Lewi hangatabo tshia dikumi; Bena Lewi nebalue ne tshia dikumi tshia mu bintu bia tshia dikumi, mu nsubu wa Nzambi wetu mu tshibutshilu tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
